---
import Article from "../components/article.astro";
import Heading from "../components/heading.astro";
import Paragraph from "../components/paragraph.astro";
import ArticleLayout from "../layouts/article.astro";
---

<ArticleLayout title="Morphology" nextPath="/morphemes">
  <Article>
    <Heading>Hello!</Heading>
    <Paragraph>Welcome to <i>remorphable.</i></Paragraph>
    <Paragraph
      >Through this interactive web experience, you will get an introduction to
      morphology, one of the many fascinating branches of linguistics. You will
      learn about many of the basic concepts in morphology, including morphemes,
      lexemes, allomorphy, inflection, derivation, and more. These words may
      sound like gibberish at the moment, but fret not! Very soon you’ll have a
      good understanding of what each of these concepts mean and why they’re
      important.</Paragraph
    >
    <Paragraph
      >The fun part? You’ll get to build your own language! Incorporating what
      you learn at each stage, you’ll gradually give shape to a conlang that
      gets more feature-rich as you progress through the website.</Paragraph
    >
  </Article>
</ArticleLayout>
